OL,3,GNEWSAProposal for free bus service
OL,4,Ascrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals for a free bus service in
OL,7,FGuernsey will no longer be considered
OL,8,Ffor next year's budget, deputies who
OL,9,Fsuggested the move have said.
OL,11,FDeputies Sally Rochester and Ross Le
OL,12,FBrun put the plan forward as an
OL,13,Famendment to the 2027 budget, asking
OL,14,Fthe Policy and Resources Committee for
OL,15,F#1.9m to "enable the existing public
OL,16,Ftransport service" to be made free of
OL,17,Fcharge in a one-year pilot.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
