OL,3,GNEWSAProposal for free bus service
OL,4,Ascrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have now pulled the plans after
OL,7,F"concern from [operator] Stagecoach"
OL,8,Fthat increased passenger numbers could
OL,9,Fmean certain routes not coping with the
OL,10,Fadditional demand.
OL,12,FRochester said she and Le Brun were
OL,13,Fcommitted to working with the
OL,14,FEnvironment and Infrastructure
OL,15,FCommittee to explore plans for the
OL,16,Ffuture.
